{
 "id": "306-49",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Always start method names with 'n_'.",
  "This is something I expect to see consistently in your code.",
  "Consistency is key, and it's important to establish these practices early on.",
  "I'll be reviewing your code regularly, so feel free to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "It's all part of the process, and I'm glad to be mentoring someone with your enthusiasm and attitude.",
  "Consistency is key in our team's coding practices.",
  "Always use annotations for methods.",
  "It provides clarity and helps other engineers understand your code more easily.",
  "Additionally, include a single digit in method names.",
  "This helps with organization and provides a unique identifier for each method.",
  "Consistency in our code is crucial for maintaining a high standard of quality.",
  "Keep up the good work, and don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "And it will also encourage a culture of continuous learning and improvement for everyone, regardless of their tenure.",
  "Now, I want you to take the lead on this project, Jorge.",
  "A robust search feature will be key to making this platform useful.",
  "We don't want our employees spending ages trying to find the information they need.",
  "Remember, this platform should be designed with scalability and ease-of-use in mind."
 ],
